WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
In addition to being strong

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,200
I can still pop this on my hand

3
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,620
It wasn't this long before

4
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,580
Not so pretty either

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,380
It’s because the attributes just skyrocketed

6
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,660
Evolved together

7
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,260
How strong is the wind?

8
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,300
How do your hands feel?

9
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,980
Do I have to break the skin every time?

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,250
I can't tell

11
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,930
Just like what I grew up with

12
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:30,850
No feeling

13
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,690
But how long and hard is he?

14
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:38,420
I feel so at ease, you ancients

15
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,900
It's probably a new organ in the body

16
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,860
Made of metal

17
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,140
Eat more Korean iron products from now on

18
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,420
Maybe the longer it gets, the harder it will be

19
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,220
One day I can cut even Tai alloys

20
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,100
Your hair is too long and it’ll be in the way when you blow it.

21
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,140
I went back and cut off the black ones and saved them for Qi Yao
